    💭 Who else may call. A page on an origin that the setting names may use the whole API;
    💭 a request from any other origin is refused before it reaches a handler, which is
    💭 what keeps a page on another site from changing the list behind a visitor's back.
    💭 A request from the sample's own page, or from no page at all, is none of its business.
