    💭 Where the directory is not: one that somebody named is a mistake, and stops the
    💭 start like any setting that makes no sense. The one the sample looks in when it is
    💭 told nothing may be missing, as when the sample's source is run somewhere by itself.
    💭 Then the API is all there is, and / says hello.
